  "description": "OpenTAXII workload view: pod CPU / memory / restarts from kube-prometheus-stack, plus gunicorn + opentaxii JSON log volume via Alloy \u2192 Loki ({namespace=\"opentaxii\",container=\"opentaxii\"}). Gunicorn access logging is off in the image (only gunicorn.error/opentaxii JSON lines exist), so log volume is the available traffic signal alongside the gatus /management/health probe.",
